<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#071b2c">
  <title>Hybrid Car GDL | Coming Soon</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #35d35b;
      --cyan: #18c9e8;
      --navy: #071b2c;
      --muted: #9eb4c4;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%, rgba(19, 139, 164, .20), transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #061522 0%, #09263a 55%, #061522 100%);
    }
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: .18;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
                        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 42px 42px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black, transparent 78%);
    }
    .wrap {
      width: min(92vw, 720px);
      padding: 54px 28px 60px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .logo {
      display: block;
      width: min(100%, 390px);
      height: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin: 0 auto 42px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 24px rgba(16, 213, 89, .12));
    }
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
      line-height: .98;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      font-weight: 850;
    }
    h1 span {
      color: var(--green);
      display: block;
    }
    .subtitle {
      max-width: 470px;
      margin: 22px auto 38px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(.98rem, 2.4vw, 1.12rem);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    .battery-area {
      width: min(100%, 350px);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .battery {
      height: 48px;
      width: 100%;
      border: 2px solid rgba(221, 246, 255, .78);
      border-radius: 9px;
      padding: 5px;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(24, 201, 232, .12), inset 0 0 12px rgba(24, 201, 232, .06);
    }
    .battery::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -9px;
      top: 13px;
      width: 6px;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
      background: rgba(221, 246, 255, .85);
    }
    .charge {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #12b9dc, #39e66b);
      box-shadow: 0 0 17px rgba(48, 226, 111, .55);
      animation: charge 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .charge-label {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #c6d8e3;
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .charge-label::after {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 1.1em;
      text-align: left;
      animation: dots 1.4s steps(4, end) infinite;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 52px;
      color: rgba(174, 198, 212, .55);
      font-size: .72rem;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    @keyframes charge {
      0% { width: 3%; opacity: .75; }
      75%, 100% { width: 100%; opacity: 1; }
    }
    @keyframes dots {
      0% { content: ""; }
      25% { content: "."; }
      50% { content: ".."; }
      75%, 100% { content: "..."; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .wrap { padding: 38px 22px; }
      .logo { width: min(100%, 310px); margin-bottom: 38px; }
      .subtitle { margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 42px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; }
      .charge { width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Próximamente</p>
    <h1>COMING <span>SOON</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Estamos preparando una nueva forma de cuidar y potenciar tu vehículo híbrido.</p>
    <div class="battery-area" aria-label="Batería cargando">
      <div class="battery"><div class="charge"></div></div>
      <div class="charge-label">Cargando energía</div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">Hybrid Car GDL · Tecnología para seguir avanzando</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
